# 2048-atom random fcc CrMnFeCoNi box -- verbatim from verify_cantor/in.bench_ace so that the
# rows in README.md are comparable with the pre-plan measurements.  Included by in.bench_ace
# and in.bench_pace; defines ${species} for their pair_coeff lines.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 3.59
region box block 0 8 0 8 0 8
create_box 5 box
create_atoms 1 box
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.2 12345
set type 1 type/fraction 3 0.25 23456
set type 1 type/fraction 4 0.3333 34567
set type 1 type/fraction 5 0.5 45678
mass 1 51.9961
mass 2 54.938
mass 3 55.845
mass 4 58.9332
mass 5 58.6934
displace_atoms all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 777
variable species string "Cr Mn Fe Co Ni"
